CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/at com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/UnitDataField
	COMMENT UnitDataField - abstract base of every per-unit data field (hp/energy/custom fields): id (int, used by the compact net writer) and name (the lower-cased ini/script key; the static UnitData.s map is keyed by it). Subclasses either proxy UnitData (UnitDataModifiedField) or the live unit (UnitEngineField). a(unit, LogicBoolean, Operator) applies =, +=, -= via the double accessors. [field names verified from code]
	FIELD a id I
	FIELD b name Ljava/lang/String;
